      }
    }
  ],
  "text": "As wielders of both occult power and firearms, gunwitches pride themselves in using both unconventional weapons and obscure magic. To change their patron (Spinner of Threads), swap out Nudge Fate and Sure Strike.\n\n---\nThese lone wolves have an aura of mystery, bravado, and swagger."
